# Game_Ball — Ball Prelling / Relay (ID 23)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Ball.h, Game_Ball.cpp
# HTML: data/game_ball_setup.html, game_ball_names.html, game_ball_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Timed relay: rotating light designates which puck to press. Press correct puck to advance.
1-6 groups with 3-5 pucks each. Sequential or random target selection.

## CONFIG
- pucksPerGroup (3-5), numGroups (1-6), durationMs
- autoRestart, soundOn, isRandom (random vs sequential)

## STATES
BALL_SETUP → BALL_COUNTDOWN (3.1s) → BALL_RUNNING → BALL_FINISHED → BALL_WAIT_RESTART (optional)

## KEY MECHANICS
- Active puck: EFF_SINGLE_CHASE in group color
- Correct press: score++, 80ms beep, advance to next
- Random: avoids same puck twice
- Sequential: cycling through pucks in order
- Per-group independent state tracking
- Auto-restart: WAIT_RESTART → press any → restart
- Layout view: progress fill (25%, 50%, 75%, 100%)
- 6 group colors: Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Magenta, Cyan

## COMMANDS
setup, show_layout, cfg_ppg, cfg_grp, cfg_time, cfg_auto, cfg_snd, cfg_rnd,
start, stop, g_start, g_stop, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{st, gT (global elapsed), lim, grps: [{id, act, st, sc, t}]}
